Mpox Vaccine Appears Safe for Use in Adolescents.,"The modified vaccinia Ankara-Bavarian Nordic (MVA-BN) vaccine is approved in several countries for use in the prevention of mpox and smallpox in adults. New research suggests it’s also safe and produces an immune response in adolescents, a population affected by the current clade I mpox outbreak.",Samantha Anderer,10.1001/jama.2024.23619,https://doi.org/10.1001/jama.2024.23619,Journal of the American Medical Association (JAMA),0,2024,yes,The study explicitly mentions adolescents rather than being limited to healthy non-pregnant adults.,yes,The article reports that research found the vaccine to be safe.,no,"The text describes a news piece reporting that ""New research suggests"" findings, rather than being a primary research study or systematic review itself.",yes,The paper discusses results in an adolescent human population.,yes,The study population includes adolescents.,yes,Participants received the vaccine during adolescence.,yes,The paper involves the MVA-BN (modified vaccinia Ankara) vaccine.,Exclude,"This paper is a news summary reporting on other research regarding the safety of the MVA-BN vaccine in adolescents. Although it discusses the correct population and intervention, it does not meet the required study design criteria for primary research or evidence synthesis.",Study Design,Study Design,0.1,"  - ""New research suggests it’s also safe and produces an immune response in adolescents,""",,"  - ""New research suggests it’s also safe and produces an immune response in adolescents,""",,"  - ""New research suggests it’s also safe and produces an immune response in adolescents,""",,"  - ""New research suggests it’s also safe and produces an immune response in adolescents,""",,"  - ""New research suggests it’s also safe and produces an immune response in adolescents,""",,"  - ""New research suggests it’s also safe and produces an immune response in adolescents,""",,"  - ""The modified vaccinia Ankara-Bavarian Nordic (MVA-BN) vaccine is approved in several countries for use in the prevention of mpox and smallpox in adults.""",
