Examination of Adverse Reactions After COVID-19 Vaccination Among Patients With a History of Multisystem Inflammatory Syndrome in Children,This cross-sectional study examines adverse reactions after COVID-19 vaccination among patients aged 5 years or older who have a history of multisystem inflammatory syndrome in children.,"Matthew D. Elias, D. Truong, M. Oster, F. Trachtenberg, Xiangyu Mu, P. Jone, E. Mitchell, Kirsten B. Dummer, S. S. Sexson Tejtel, Onyekachukwu Osakwe, D. Thacker, J. Su, T. Bradford, Kristin M. Burns, M. J. Campbell, T. Connors, L. D’Addese, D. Forsha, Olivia Frosch, T. Giglia, Lauren Goodell, Stephanie S. Handler, Keren Hasbani, Camden L Hebson, A. Krishnan, S. Lang, B. McCrindle, Kimberly E. McHugh, Lerraughn M. Morgan, R. Payne, Arash A. Sabati, E. Sagiv, Yamuna Sanil, F. Serrano, J. Newburger, Audrey Dionne, Gail Pearson, Victoria L. Pemberton, D’Andrea Egerson, Lynn Mahony, Julie Miller, Kerri Hayes, Allison Crosby-Thompson, A. Amarnath, James Ambrosoli, Cassandra Artis, Kay Rubio*, Chitra Kinhikar*, Amanda Marshall, Devine Mbiydzenyuy*, Valentina Kazlova, Chenwei Hu, Lozan Eyob, Beverly Slayton, Lauren DiStefano, J. Honig, Tiffany Bowie*, Rob Nero*, Emily Birmingham, Robin Rowe, Melissa Joyce, Cole Gallagher*, Djenawa Bowman*, Mo Zhang, Alissa Mooney*, A. Dragulescu, Christopher Lam, Rae Yeung, B. Gamulka, J. Bainton, Martha Rolland, Patti Walter*, Simran Mahanta, Thomas Giorgio, Numaira Khan, Annette Baker, Lisa Jean Buckley, Jessica M. Jones, LaTina Watson*, Anna Clarke*, Tor-Samuel-Aleer Leek*, Gwendolyn Orav, T. Morrison, Katherine Lupton, Donna Sylvester, Dana Albizem, Kristin Lanzilotta, Grace Marks, Madison Johnson, Megan Bickford, Linda Lambert, Lilly Fagatele, Andrea Curless, Mark W. Russell, Tammy Doman, Marisa Almaguer, Lauryn Dugan, Kathleen A. Rathge, Elizabeth Seibert*, Mary Stumpf, Jennifer Howell, Jyoti K. Patel, Gloria Mitscher*, Melissa Burnett, Kolby Sanders-Lewis, Brooke Evans, W. Mahle, L. Kochilas, Madison Rudow*, Sus