Monkeypox infection in pregnancy: a systematic review and meta-analysis,"Objective . The main aim of this systematic review was to ascertain the maternal and perinatal outcomes of pregnancies complicated by monkeypox infection. Materials and Methods . Medline, Embase and Cochrane databases were searched utilizing combinations of the relevant medical subject heading terms, key words, and word variants for “monkeypox” and “pregnancy”. The outcomes observed were miscarriage, intra-uterine, neonatal and perinatal death, preterm birth, vertical transmission, maternal symptoms. Meta-analysis of proportion was used to analyze the data.","L. D. Valle, T. D. Vita, Francesca Di, Danilo Italo, Pio Buca, M. Liberati, F. D'antonio",10.36129/jog.2022.s59,https://doi.org/10.36129/jog.2022.s59,Italian journal of gynaecology & obstetrics,4,2023,yes,"The study focuses on pregnant women, not healthy non-pregnant adults.",maybe,"The study reports outcomes of mpox infection such as miscarriage, death, and preterm birth. This relates to the burden of disease but does not assess vaccine effectiveness or safety as no vaccine is mentioned.",yes,The study is a systematic review and meta-analysis.,yes,The study evaluates outcomes in human pregnancies.,yes,The study specifically includes pregnant women as participants.,no,"The study focuses on the outcomes of mpox infection in pregnancy, not the administration of vaccines during pregnancy or other specified periods.",no,The study does not involve or mention vaccinia-based mpox vaccines or smallpox vaccines; it investigates infection outcomes.,Exclude,"This is a systematic review focused on the outcomes of monkeypox infection during pregnancy. It does not evaluate vaccination or vaccinated populations, failing the requirements for vaccine timing and type.","Vaccination Timing, Vaccine Type",Vaccination Timing,0.1,"  - ""ascertain the maternal and perinatal outcomes of pregnancies complicated by monkeypox infection.""",,"  - ""The outcomes observed were miscarriage, intra-uterine, neonatal and perinatal death, preterm birth, vertical transmission, maternal symptoms.""",,,,"  - ""ascertain the maternal and perinatal outcomes of pregnancies complicated by monkeypox infection.""",,"  - ""ascertain the maternal and perinatal outcomes of pregnancies complicated by monkeypox infection.""",,"  - ""ascertain the maternal and perinatal outcomes of pregnancies complicated by monkeypox infection.""
