  - ""Hanna, Assistant Medical Officer of Health for the port, analysed so impressively in his monograph.""",,"  - ""A large outbreak of smallpox in Liverpool during 1902–3 was studied in great detail,""",,"  - ""Hanna’s data therefore concern the effects of childhood primary vaccination only on subsequent smallpox.""",,"  - ""Hanna’s data therefore concern the effects of childhood primary vaccination only on subsequent smallpox.""
